---
interface Props { data: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="miles-experience">
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap crumb"><b>Viajes</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; ¿Valen las millas?</div><div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div class="copy"><span class="eyebrow">Decisión de viaje</span><h1>¿Usás las millas<br>o pagás el<br>pasaje?</h1><p>Convertí tu canje en un número comparable. Mirá cuánto rinde cada milla y elegí la opción que conserva más valor.</p><div class="chips"><span>✈ Canje vs. efectivo</span><span>¢ Valor por milla</span><span>✓ Tasas incluidas</span></div><div class="travel-art"><div class="globe"><i></i></div><div class="ticket"><small>TU CANJE RINDE</small><strong>1,30 ¢/milla</strong><span>Conviene canjear</span></div><span class="route-tag">EZE → MIA · Económica</span></div></div>
<form class="calc"><div class="calc-title"><div><h2>Compará tu canje</h2><p>Empezamos por un pasaje completo.</p></div><span class="tag">Decisión instantánea</span></div><div class="section-label">¿Qué estás evaluando?</div><div class="cases"><button type="button" class="case active" data-case="flight"><i>🎫</i>Canjear un pasaje</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="points"><i>💳</i>Puntos de tarjeta</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="upgrade"><i>🛫</i>Upgrade de cabina</button><button type="button" class="case" data-case="balance"><i>🏦</i>Valuar mi saldo</button></div><div class="section-label">Datos del canje</div><div class="fields"><div class="field wide"><label>Programa de millas o puntos</label><select id="program"><option value="1.4">LifeMiles</option><option value="1.25">LATAM Pass</option><option value="1.5">AAdvantage</option><option value="1.35">MileagePlus</option><option value="1.1">Smiles</option><option value="1.05">Aerolíneas Plus</option><option value="1">Otro programa</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Millas o puntos necesarios</label><input id="miles" inputmode="numeric" value="60.000"></div><div class="field"><label>Precio en efectivo</label><div class="inline"><b>USD</b><input id="cash" type="number" min="0" value="900"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Tasas del canje</label><div class="inline"><b>USD</b><input id="fees" type="number" min="0" value="120"></div></div><div class="field"><label>Cabina</label><select id="cabin"><option>Económica</option><option>Premium economy</option><option>Business</option><option>First</option></select></div></div><div class="advanced"><span>✓ Compará contra el precio que pagarías hoy</span><button type="button" id="advanced-toggle">+ Afinar comparación</button></div><div class="extra" id="extra-fields"><div class="field"><label>Cotización USD en pesos</label><input id="fx" inputmode="numeric" value="1.400"></div><div class="field"><label>Comisión de transferencia</label><div class="inline"><input id="transfer-fee" type="number" min="0" value="0"><b>%</b></div></div></div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">Valor obtenido por cada milla</small><div class="value" id="result-value">1,30 ¢</div></div><div class="verdict"><small>Decisión sugerida</small><strong id="verdict">Conviene canjear</strong></div></div><div class="stats"><span>Ahorro real<b id="saving">USD 780</b></span><span>Referencia del programa<b id="benchmark">1,40 ¢</b></span><span>Valor en pesos<b id="ars-value">$1.092.000</b></span></div><button class="go" id="update" type="button">Actualizar comparación</button></section></form>
</div></section>
<section class="meter-section"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>La respuesta en una escala</span><h2>Dónde cae tu canje</h2><p>Cuanto más valor obtenés por cada milla, más sentido tiene usarla ahora en vez de pagar.</p></header><div class="meter-card"><div class="meter"><i class="pin" id="pin"></i></div><div class="meter-labels"><div><b>Guardá las millas</b>Menos de 0,9 ¢</div><div><b>Está parejo</b>0,9 a 1,3 ¢</div><div><b>Buen canje</b>Más de 1,3 ¢</div></div><div class="meter-summary"><span>Tu canje actual evita pagar USD 780 usando 60.000 millas.</span><b id="meter-verdict">Rinde 1,30 ¢ por milla</b></div></div></div></section>
<section class="breakdown"><div class="wrap break-grid"><article class="card"><h3>La cuenta completa</h3><div class="line"><span>Precio del mismo pasaje en efectivo</span><b id="detail-cash">USD 900</b></div><div class="line"><span>Tasas que pagás aunque uses millas</span><b id="detail-fees">− USD 120</b></div><div class="line"><span>Ahorro real del canje</span><b id="detail-saving">USD 780</b></div><div class="line"><span>Millas necesarias</span><b id="detail-miles">60.000</b></div><div class="line total"><strong>Valor por milla</strong><b id="detail-value">1,30 ¢</b></div></article><article class="card"><h3>La fórmula, sin vueltas</h3><div class="formula-step"><i>1</i><div><b>Partimos del precio real</b><span>La tarifa que efectivamente pagarías en efectivo.</span></div></div><div class="formula-step"><i>2</i><div><b>Restamos tasas y cargos</b><span>Son plata que igual sale de tu bolsillo.</span></div></div><div class="formula-step"><i>3</i><div><b>Dividimos por las millas</b><span>Y expresamos el resultado en centavos de dólar.</span></div></div><div class="warning">⚠️ No compares contra una tarifa flexible que nunca comprarías. Usá el precio más barato con condiciones equivalentes.</div></article></div></section>
<section class="programs"><div class="wrap"><div class="program-head"><div><span>Referencias orientativas</span><h2>No todas las millas parten del mismo valor</h2></div><p>Valores de decisión, no precios oficiales</p></div><div class="program-grid"><article class="program"><i>🟠</i><h3>LifeMiles</h3><p>Buena disponibilidad regional y canjes internacionales.</p><strong>≈ 1,40 ¢</strong><span>Referencia</span></article><article class="program"><i>🔴</i><h3>LATAM Pass</h3><p>Valor variable según ruta, cabina y demanda.</p><strong>≈ 1,25 ¢</strong><span>Referencia</span></article><article class="program active"><i>🔵</i><h3>AAdvantage</h3><p>Suele rendir mejor en cabinas premium y socios.</p><strong>≈ 1,50 ¢</strong><span>Mayor referencia</span></article><article class="program"><i>🇦🇷</i><h3>Aerolíneas Plus</h3><p>Útil para vuelos domésticos y regionales.</p><strong>≈ 1,05 ¢</strong><span>Referencia</span></article></div></div></section>
<section class="rules"><div class="wrap rules-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#8fcdf0">Tres filtros antes de canjear</span><h2>El número importa, pero no viaja solo.</h2><p>La disponibilidad, la flexibilidad del pasaje y el vencimiento de tus millas pueden cambiar una decisión que parecía obvia.</p></div><div class="rules-card"><div><small>DISPONIBILIDAD</small><b>¿Viaja tu fecha?</b><span>Un gran valor sin lugar disponible no sirve.</span></div><div><small>VENCIMIENTO</small><b>¿Caducan pronto?</b><span>Usarlas puede ser mejor que perderlas.</span></div><div><small>FLEXIBILIDAD</small><b>¿Permite cambios?</b><span>Compará condiciones equivalentes.</span></div></div></div></section><div class="foot"></div>
  <section class="support wrap">
    <div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div>
    <aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside>
  </section>
</div>
<script is:inline>

const $=s=>document.querySelector(s),num=v=>Number(String(v).replace(/\./g,"").replace(",", "."))||0,fmt=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat("es-AR").format(Math.round(n));let activeCase="flight";
function calc(){const miles=Math.max(1,num($("#miles").value)),cash=num($("#cash").value),fees=num($("#fees").value),fx=num($("#fx").value),commission=num($("#transfer-fee").value)/100,benchmark=Number($("#program").value),effectiveMiles=miles*(1+commission),saving=Math.max(0,cash-fees),cpp=saving/effectiveMiles*100;let label="Valor obtenido por cada milla";if(activeCase==="points")label="Valor de tus puntos transferidos";if(activeCase==="upgrade")label="Valor obtenido por el upgrade";if(activeCase==="balance")label="Valor estimado de todo tu saldo";const verdict=cpp>=benchmark?"Conviene canjear":cpp>=benchmark*.8?"Está bastante parejo":"Mejor pagar en efectivo";$("#result-label").textContent=label;$("#result-value").textContent=`${cpp.toFixed(2).replace(".",",")} ¢`;$("#verdict").textContent=verdict;$("#saving").textContent=`USD ${fmt(saving)}`;$("#benchmark").textContent=`${benchmark.toFixed(2).replace(".",",")} ¢`;$("#ars-value").textContent=`$${fmt(saving*fx)}`;$("#detail-cash").textContent=`USD ${fmt(cash)}`;$("#detail-fees").textContent=`− USD ${fmt(fees)}`;$("#detail-saving").textContent=`USD ${fmt(saving)}`;$("#detail-miles").textContent=fmt(miles);$("#detail-value").textContent=`${cpp.toFixed(2).replace(".",",")} ¢`;$("#meter-verdict").textContent=`Rinde ${cpp.toFixed(2).replace(".",",")} ¢ por milla`;$("#pin").style.left=`${Math.min(100,cpp/2.25*100)}%`}
document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(b=>b.addEventListener("click",()=>{document.querySelectorAll(".case").forEach(x=>x.classList.remove("active"));b.classList.add("active");activeCase=b.dataset.case;calc()}));document.querySelectorAll("input,select").forEach(i=>i.addEventListener("input",calc));$("#advanced-toggle").addEventListener("click",e=>{$("#extra-fields").classList.toggle("open");e.currentTarget.textContent=$("#extra-fields").classList.contains("open")?"− Ocultar opciones":"+ Afinar comparación"});$("#update").addEventListener("click",e=>{calc();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Comparación actualizada";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Actualizar comparación",1200)});calc();

</script>
<style>
.miles-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden;color:#10223c;background:#fff}

*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:#10233c;background:#fff}button,input,select{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.top{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe8ef;display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;font-size:18px;font-weight:850}.logo{width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:7px;background:#173452;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:13px}.links,.tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:27px}.links a{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#43526a}.tools span{border:1px solid #d9e2eb;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tools .profile{background:#132844;color:#fff;border-color:#132844}
.hero{background:linear-gradient(128deg,#f5faff 0%,#f5faff 58%,#edf9f7 100%);padding:25px 0 62px;overflow:hidden}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:#718299;margin-bottom:32px}.crumb b{color:#167bba}.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:52px;align-items:start}.hero-grid>*{min-width:0}.copy{padding-top:6px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#167bba;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:#167bba}.copy h1{font-size:51px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.052em;margin:18px 0;color:#10213a}.copy>p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.65;color:#53677e;max-width:505px}.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:23px}.chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe5ed;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;color:#4d6279;font-size:10px}
.travel-art{height:238px;margin-top:15px;position:relative}.globe{position:absolute;left:54px;top:18px;width:182px;height:182px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#caebf5,#8dd5d0);border:10px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 24px 48px #17385818;overflow:hidden}.globe:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:24px 49px;border:3px solid #fff;border-radius:50%}.globe:after{content:"✈";position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#fff;font-size:48px;transform:rotate(-12deg)}.globe i{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:50%;border-top:3px solid #fff}.ticket{position:absolute;right:23px;top:39px;width:190px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #d7e3eb;border-radius:15px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 20px 42px #17385815;transform:rotate(2deg)}.ticket small{font-size:8px;color:#61768b}.ticket strong{display:block;font-size:25px;color:#126ea7;margin:7px 0 10px}.ticket span{font-size:9px;color:#14775b;background:#e6f6ef;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:99px}.route-tag{position:absolute;left:4px;bottom:12px;background:#e8f4ff;color:#176fac;border:1px solid #cfe3f2;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800}
.calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d8e4eb;border-radius:20px;padding:26px 29px;box-shadow:0 25px 60px #173b6418;position:relative;z-index:2}.calc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.calc h2{font-size:23px;margin:0 0 4px}.calc-title p{font-size:10px;color:#60758c;margin:0}.tag{font-size:9px;color:#14775b;background:#e6f6ef;border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;font-weight:800;height:max-content;white-space:nowrap}.section-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:850;color:#293b53;margin:17px 0 8px}.cases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.case{border:1px solid #dce5ec;background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 4px;color:#52677f;font-size:8px;font-weight:750;min-height:66px}.case i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:17px;margin-bottom:3px}.case.active{border:2px solid #247fc1;background:#eff7fd;color:#166aa4}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.field{border:1px solid #dbe4eb;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:57px}.field.wide{grid-column:span 2}.field label{display:block;color:#63788e;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.field input,.field select{border:0;outline:0;background:none;width:100%;color:#142641;font-weight:750;font-size:13px}.inline{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px}.inline b{font-size:12px}.advanced{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:11px 0;color:#566d84;font-size:9px}.advanced button{border:0;background:none;color:#167bba;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;padding:0}.extra{display:none;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px;margin-bottom:10px}.extra.open{display:grid}.result{background:#17324f;color:#fff;border-radius:15px;padding:18px 20px}.result-top{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}.result small{font-size:9px;color:#c5d3df}.value{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;font-weight:850;margin-top:4px}.verdict{background:#e6f6ef;color:#126d51;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 11px;text-align:right}.verdict small{color:inherit}.verdict strong{display:block;font-size:14px}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #375675;padding-top:12px;margin-top:13px}.stats span{font-size:8px;color:#b9cad8}.stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:3px}.go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:9px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#247fc1,#26a584);color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:12px;margin-top:14px}
.meter-section{padding:74px 0 68px}.center{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 36px}.center span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#167bba;font-weight:850}.center h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0}.center p{color:#5e7288;line-height:1.6}.meter-card{border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:17px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 12px 30px #1738580b}.meter{height:18px;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fde8e7 0 29%,#fff1d5 29% 48%,#e4f5ed 48% 100%);position:relative;margin:58px 12px 20px}.pin{position:absolute;left:58%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:#167bba;border:6px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 5px 14px #1d6c9d40}.pin:before{content:"1,30 ¢";position:absolute;bottom:34px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;background:#17324f;color:#fff;padding:7px 9px;border-radius:7px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800}.meter-labels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:29% 19% 52%;font-size:9px;text-align:center;color:#597086}.meter-labels b{display:block;font-size:11px;margin-bottom:4px;color:#24364c}.meter-summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;background:#f7fafc;border-radius:11px;padding:14px 16px;margin-top:21px}.meter-summary span{font-size:10px;color:#5c7187}.meter-summary b{font-size:14px;color:#14775b}
.breakdown{background:#f4f8fb;padding:68px 0}.break-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:20px}.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:16px;padding:25px;box-shadow:0 10px 27px #1738580b}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 19px}.line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5ebf0}.line span{font-size:10px;color:#5d7186}.line b{font-size:12px}.line.total{background:#e9f6f1;border:0;border-radius:10px;color:#126e52;padding:14px 15px;margin-top:12px}.formula-step{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin:14px 0}.formula-step i{font-style:normal;width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:10px;background:#e8f4ff;color:#167bba;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:850}.formula-step b{display:block;font-size:10px}.formula-step span{display:block;color:#65798f;font-size:9px;margin-top:3px}.warning{background:#fff7e7;border:1px solid #efdaad;border-radius:11px;padding:13px;margin-top:17px;color:#755319;font-size:9px;line-height:1.55}
.programs{padding:69px 0}.program-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:27px}.program-head span{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#167bba;font-weight:850}.program-head h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 0}.program-head p{font-size:9px;color:#60758a}.program-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}.program{border:1px solid #dce5ec;border-radius:14px;padding:18px}.program.active{border:2px solid #247fc1}.program i{font-style:normal;font-size:22px}.program h3{font-size:12px;margin:10px 0 5px}.program p{font-size:8px;color:#65798d;line-height:1.5}.program strong{display:block;font-size:20px;color:#173858;margin-top:12px}.program span{font-size:8px;color:#60758a}.program.active span{color:#167bba;font-weight:800}
.rules{background:#17324f;color:#fff;padding:66px 0}.rules-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.74fr 1.26fr;gap:48px;align-items:center}.rules h2{font-size:35px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:10px 0 13px}.rules p{color:#c0cfdd;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}.rules-card{background:#fff;color:#17324f;border-radius:16px;padding:22px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.rules-card div{background:#f5f8fb;border-radius:11px;padding:15px;text-align:center}.rules-card small{display:block;color:#60758a;font-size:8px}.rules-card b{display:block;font-size:17px;margin:7px 0}.rules-card span{font-size:8px;color:#5c7186}.foot{height:110px}
@media(max-width:800px){.wrap{width:min(100% - 28px,1160px)}.links{display:none}.hero-grid,.break-grid,.rules-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.copy{text-align:center}.copy h1{font-size:39px}.eyebrow,.chips{justify-content:center}.travel-art{max-width:390px;margin-inline:auto}.calc{padding:20px 16px}.cases{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.program-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.tools span:not(:last-child){display:none}}@media(max-width:480px){.copy h1{font-size:36px}.globe{left:17px}.ticket{right:0}.fields,.extra{grid-template-columns:1fr}.field.wide{grid-column:auto}.stats,.program-grid,.rules-card{grid-template-columns:1fr}.meter-summary{display:block}.meter-summary b{display:block;margin-top:8px}}

.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#5f7187}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:#1769bd;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#65798d;margin-top:4px}
@media(max-width:800px){.support{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
